const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究的是币种之间的收益差异",en:"Explaining differences across coins"},body:{zh:"这篇研究关注不同加密资产为何表现不同，而不只是比特币涨跌与宏观变量的关系。横截面比较需要在同一观察时点定义可选资产集合。单独一条币价序列即使很长，也不能替代多资产样本中的共同波动与特征差异。",en:"The question concerns differences across cryptocurrencies, not just Bitcoin's time-series relation to macro variables. Cross-sectional analysis requires a contemporaneous investment universe; a long series for one coin cannot substitute for multiple assets and their characteristics."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · pp. 1–2",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"样本集合随时间改变",en:"The universe changes over time"},body:{zh:"工作稿使用2014至2018年的历史数据，并设定市值门槛，样本中的币种数量随市场发展明显增加。因此，研究对象不是从今天仍然存在的币种倒推出来的固定清单。市值筛选、进入时间与退出记录都会影响如何理解结果。",en:"The draft studies 2014–2018 with a market-capitalization threshold and an expanding set of coins. This is not a fixed list reconstructed from today's survivors. Entry, exit and capitalization filters matter when interpreting its historical evidence."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · p. 1",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · p. 1"}}},{title:{zh:"同名特征不等于同一种经济含义",en:"Similar labels need not imply similar economics"},body:{zh:"作者选择可以从价格和市场活动构造的特征，并与股票研究中的指标联系起来。规模、成交量和动量可以寻找对应物，公司账面权益却不能直接移植到代币。使用股票文献的名称，不会自动赋予加密资产相同的现金流或所有权基础。",en:"The selected characteristics can be constructed from prices and market activity. Size, volume and momentum have market-based counterparts, whereas corporate book equity does not transfer directly to tokens. Shared terminology does not establish common cash-flow or ownership foundations."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · pp. 1–2",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"先排序，再观察下一期",en:"Sort first, observe the following period"},body:{zh:"工作稿按特征形成分组，再观察下一周收益。这里最重要的是信息先后顺序：用于分组的市值和价格信息必须属于形成时点，而不是结果期结束后回填的值。周度排序的证据也不能直接解释为日内交易信号。",en:"The draft forms characteristic-sorted groups and examines returns over the following week. Inputs must be available at formation, not revised using end-of-outcome information. Evidence from weekly sorts also does not directly establish an intraday trading signal."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · p. 2",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · p. 2"}}},{title:{zh:"三个因子是一种解释框架",en:"Three factors form an explanatory framework"},body:{zh:"市场、规模和动量构成工作稿提出的简洁因子框架，用来解释所检验组合之间的收益差异。因子可以共同变动，其统计解释力与“找到了三种独立经济风险”不是同一回事。对照股票因子模型时，应把可观测组合与经济机制分开。",en:"Market, size and momentum provide a parsimonious framework for the tested portfolios. Factors may covary. Statistical explanatory power is different from identifying three independent economic risks; observable factor portfolios and their proposed mechanisms remain distinct."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · pp. 1–2",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"解释历史组合，不等于可直接投资",en:"Explaining portfolios is not an implementation result"},body:{zh:"研究将大量候选特征放在同一框架中比较，价值在于梳理哪些差异可以被共同因子吸收。实际使用还需要额外核对交易费用、流动性、币种消失和数据修订。论文中的历史组合不是平台已提供或已经验证的投资产品。",en:"Comparing characteristics within one framework shows which differences can be absorbed by common factors. Costs, liquidity, disappearing coins and revisions require separate implementation evidence. Historical research portfolios are not validated investment products supplied by this platform."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25882/w25882.pdf",label:{zh:"2019年5月NBER工作稿 · pp. 1–2",en:"May 2019 NBER draft · pp. 1–2"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读依据2019年工作稿，不以2022年期刊版的结果替换。历史样本中的因子解释力不证明当前风险补偿、可交易收益或跨交易所执行可行性。",en:"This guide uses the 2019 draft, without substituting results from the 2022 journal version. Historical factor fit establishes neither current compensation nor attainable cross-venue returns."}};export{e as default};
